<title>西班牙11月11日爆发全国性大罢工和示威活动。此次大罢工由西班牙工人委员会和劳工总联盟组织发起，呼吁解决住房成本上涨、工</title>
<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35773</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35773</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 02:23:23 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">西班牙11月11日爆发全国性大罢工和示威活动。<br/>此次大罢工由西班牙工人委员会和劳工总联盟组织发起，呼吁解决住房成本上涨、工资购买力下降等问题，并要求改善公共服务。<br/>工会表示，全国范围内约400万人参加罢工。西班牙各地的交通和公共服务严重中断。多地爆发罢工者与警方冲突，超50人被捕。<br/>（<a href="https://www.news.cn/20261112/ab9e2ec730e041e290450ec0ff7fbc75/c.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">新华社</a>，<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/11/11/europe/spain-strike-housing-latam-intl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">CNN</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/f6po0BPVwZpwPTxfUs8VEMwgaruk_E6FNKbCXuQWO7N1yoRZEbFzzluLuVV72EZfp9LLHS4p6MxFculG2yOCY1KyRQRPVNdVHevz3xwRtTsmra7W8QtFPN__YP8issZzkp-ugdLO-TpY8llQ-9c71EJvCJX_Yio5lwoDrH6mGvzorA3Q2MS2AAwNSxbMmkGhdoRUe2apD50J4_pyvLrWN6M-369bejmznM2A_H_yH4XoOwixQoBiScAldUbDlsAU5VT7liA9SnCf76UmSMvU1YNi1-o6mI3FfrTFrKJP8bIWTsA3VNqTrou-kDPbF7fGNHtFlu5Vv6Eg4LoQslFNfw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/tMnRecfl_MDJjyySRofT9t3artP5Zb2a6OVK4h18yu81RRWKsfJBiGTxsRtKGJ56vyZD4dc5JTz0_ZsrYCsOIFWadZgh9ppqKJ_hM0Kn5ySzam_YQ8PQx4yHzG04ROj8w-JJjXMbh3F9HjUJ6zRVDnlcEDsXF1CiHeHnrEwiyllQ-7WXHOVh7QGUTbY8ouXG59lFXZ3GPwuKDq3u6FAHSnV_uNQ25zHHa0bGtqZo4IbUfA7Ft1ySUCGDMJnv1nZCuOwGJX6ymDu5YjxkH6j6Yc91HHyexzv_hY6Yo5m3z1mOZJ_4zvidOqO4uReUGyOxIA6iLMOt40DdAA2X7tUyBA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/PVE9Mgr5JnFzxmSfnuJGM4tQOUkwACCmax64lSigyQp6ZTfB-QzS_QGJRrKSoUgY4DQsm46SKUwTLVI4FOVKZSm-H9mng2-iGQXKmphfYAhP0IBqxNLWA0QKv15Ql1FEqu9bRUkA-8NPguKkGUUGA8r0nLfs-dEzy-tqLfNVrk920mueGyFFshdFaoT18ieaPmI4FhXfq9HrXjr9bXL5eO_Yswsa3gd5PY-e_HrF1bdnteQK39uyznUY5dl0IrOk3FFTeI-Oa6ZGyX2idSfGF6-RRDmKr6eajmKjKlm1dwx_xdRb--otwpcbiZFTZzF1pjblYRgP90A47KrHQiG51A.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%